# Image builds send only what the Dockerfiles in deploy/containers copy.
# Everything else stays out of the build context, above all the world,
# server.properties, secrets and docs/ when building from a server folder
# or a checkout with local files in it.
*
!web/
!sites/
!deploy/server.json
!deploy/containers/
!scripts/fetch-server.sh
# Built binaries a local `go build` may leave behind.
web/play
web/admin
